      {
        "id": 57363,
        "name": "Koey",
        "username": "Koey",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koey/{size}/2187_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-05T03:54:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Out of curiosity, since the survey says Side A only and Side B only. I am wondering which Villans do people only play half of the Advanced rules most on?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Finally got my first Advanced game last night. Would say choosing Spite, with Nightmist, Omnitron, Eternal Haka and AZ. Was not the best choice to experience Advance for the first time. That extra 1 reduce was harsh with no damage buff and luck got worse when his first card was bounce 2 ongoing/equipment. Eventually won when we got Omnitron self-sustained to not taking more than 2 damage a turn and able to heal himself 2 HP.</p>",
