      {
        "id": 57366,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-05T20:49:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Voss and the Ennead are the ones that I play advanced and basic on different sides.</p><p>For Voss I like to play his side A on basic and side B on advanced. It makes it more important to decide when to let him flip.</p><p>For the Ennead, basic on side A means you will rarely see a flip. But the difference between basic and advanced is so much that I will sometimes play side A on advanced and side B on normal.</p>",
