        "created_at": "2013-04-06T01:20:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>only 5 games not advanced has the ennead flipped. Out of i think its 78. That is a stat I track :P</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It /is/ possible for the Ennead to flip on not advanced (there are cards that play another obviously) but its just a rare occurance.</p>",
